{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everything moves when you move.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/c7a22c83cf6fa561f27fe1ee0da016ad.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.mp4?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alternate between bold action and careful planning.\u00a0Bullets hang frozen in mid-air. Enemies lurk in stasis. But the second you move, so does everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/eb48d2434a49842665487891eecde363.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/171121eba08e0140faeb047c7b06565f.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=323 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/171121eba08e0140faeb047c7b06565f.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each character has a unique set of abilities. From the old-fashioned dodge roll to bullet reflecting kinetic surges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/1baf524d691788d116e598c065f168dc.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.mp4?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cowboys with knives, clockwork lifeforms, parasitic insect swarms, diesel-powered mole-men, and war-torn hellscapes are only some of the wild combinations a Chronosphere will create after consuming a world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/93b1f1aedcb73107775204836c13c9e1.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.mp4?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find unique weapons and abilities, and create loadouts blending gear and skills from different worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/aafc5be1c575b11f2bf345a83d1b79db.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ccf06be8a39278cccebb8e0af5b5a3f.avif?t=1764699983\" width=800 height=564 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The rules of physics melt inside a Chronosphere: anticipate distortions, mutations, and plunderable paradoxes. Flow seamlessly between real-time action and turn-based tactics. Choose between stabilizing your wounds or saving reality. The deeper you go, the weirder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/c9f510574a8d7cfe016bb074972ee1d8.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=152 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1969810?t=1764699983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/cc52342a354f85f4c944718b8485fdc1cfbf5c93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764699983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/c91d3bd42be2c995140c874f0e0fc5b7a94940e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764699983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/c91d3bd42be2c995140c874f0e0fc5b7a94940e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764699983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2162560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/f6030be41dfb3edf32b419d19b5b5a37.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/f6030be41dfb3edf32b419d19b5b5a37.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/f6030be41dfb3edf32b419d19b5b5a37.mp4?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time stops between turns.</strong> Bullets and enemies only move when you move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines the adrenaline of <i>real-time combat</i> <strong>with</strong> <i>turn-based tactics.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock characters with unique combat styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two chronospheres are alike! <strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> keep it fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, unlock new biomes, weapons, gear, characters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield sniper rifles, scimitars, scuttling insects, sledgehammers, shotguns (and that\u2019s just weapons that start with \u2018S\u2019).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychedelic art and a killer soundtrack.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everything moves when you move.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/c7a22c83cf6fa561f27fe1ee0da016ad.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.mp4?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alternate between bold action and careful planning.\u00a0Bullets hang frozen in mid-air. Enemies lurk in stasis. But the second you move, so does everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/eb48d2434a49842665487891eecde363.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/171121eba08e0140faeb047c7b06565f.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=323 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/171121eba08e0140faeb047c7b06565f.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each character has a unique set of abilities. From the old-fashioned dodge roll to bullet reflecting kinetic surges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/1baf524d691788d116e598c065f168dc.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.mp4?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cowboys with knives, clockwork lifeforms, parasitic insect swarms, diesel-powered mole-men, and war-torn hellscapes are only some of the wild combinations a Chronosphere will create after consuming a world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/93b1f1aedcb73107775204836c13c9e1.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.poster.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.webm?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.mp4?t=1764699983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find unique weapons and abilities, and create loadouts blending gear and skills from different worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/aafc5be1c575b11f2bf345a83d1b79db.webp?t=1764699983\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ccf06be8a39278cccebb8e0af5b5a3f.avif?t=1764699983\" width=800 height=564 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The rules of physics melt inside a Chronosphere: anticipate distortions, mutations, and plunderable paradoxes. Flow seamlessly between real-time action and turn-based tactics. Choose between stabilizing your wounds or saving reality. The deeper you go, the weirder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/c9f510574a8d7cfe016bb074972ee1d8.avif?t=1764699983\" width=600 height=152 /></span></p>","developers":["Effort Star"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/25b6b5593c6dc1f8a0dafdf2c346291d471d3fbd/header.jpg?t=1764699983","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sierra 10.12+</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sierra 10.12+</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1969810/521740559/695b847cf15757f6bee393b9d6f77de0f3e82d43/1759109199/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764324438","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1969810/521740559/695b847cf15757f6bee393b9d6f77de0f3e82d43/1759109199/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764324438","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1969810/521740559/695b847cf15757f6bee393b9d6f77de0f3e82d43/1759109199/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764324438","id":257208210,"name":"Enter the Chronosphere - Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset