_da88e4984c648f6cb7c7c0df44db9ca944801094.600x338.jpg?t=1764699983"}],"short_description":"Everything moves when you do in Enter the Chronosphere, the turn-based bullet hell roguelike. Each chronosphere is procedurally generated with defenders and biomes from the worlds it has consumed. Break in, find exotic weaponry and gadgets, outsmart hostile aliens, and fight your way to the core.","steam_appid":1969810,"support_info":{"email":"ivan+etc@joystickventures.com","url":"https://www.joystickventures.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Turkish","type":"game","website":"https://www.joystickventures.com/portfolio/enter-the-chronosphere"}